        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Asher, Esperanza Spalding, Sara Watkins, Waddy Wachtel\n- Products: Love Has Come for You, Bright Star\n- Topics: music production, musical collaboration\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Asher was born on 22 June 1944 and is a British guitarist, singer, manager, and record producer.\n- Peter Asher produced the album Love Has Come for You.\n- Love Has Come for You features musical appearances by Esperanza Spalding, Sara Watkins, Waddy Wachtel, and others.\n- In 2013, Love Has Come for You was a bluegrass album involved in a Grammy-winning collaboration.\n- Bright Star was inspired by the Grammy-winning collaboration on the 2013 bluegrass album Love Has Come for You.",
